# Copy to .env for local overrides (never commit .env). Every variable here is read
# by the loadConfig block in src/main.ts - keep the two in sync.
PORT=3000
# Left unset on purpose, and NOT settable from here: the framework runtime reads NODE_ENV
# while modules evaluate, which is before this file is loaded, so a value written here reaches
# the app's own config and never the runtime's dev flag. `npm start` declares production for
# both (src/deploy-env.ts), `azeroth dev` declares development, and a Dockerfile or process
# manager declares its own. Set it in the ENVIRONMENT to force a mode.
# NODE_ENV=development
